1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,132
Six parts.

2
00:00:01,132 --> 00:00:13,346
The sine law, the cosine law, the tangent law, the projection laws, the half angle laws, and finally the area of a triangle with its circumcircle, incircle and excircles.

3
00:00:13,346 --> 00:00:18,958
One triangle, thirteen, fourteen, fifteen, will run through all of them.

